IMPORTANT NOTE ABOUT THIS PROJECT

This software uses Baileys, an unofficial library that connects to WhatsApp
through the WhatsApp Web protocol. Doing so may violate WhatsApp's Terms of
Service, and the linked number may be restricted or banned. The author is not
affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta.

You are solely responsible for how you use it and for complying with applicable
law, including the processing of your contacts' personal data.
